  "vibe": "A street market after dark. #221430 plum night, #ffb454 lantern amber, and a #59d4a4 mint that takes over the entire CTA frame. Baloo 2 is set uppercase on every single beat — chunky, rounded, shouted. Overhead, two sagging strings of festoon bulbs flicker on independent phases; an amber-and-chalk striped stall awning fills the bottom-right above a dark valance bar; a hanging mint sign swings ±7° on its wire; a thick curl of smoke drifts up the left edge. Feature cards sit deliberately askew on the tilt variant, montage tiles lean up to 3°, and the camera is the busiest in the batch — pushes, hops, and an outright spin at multiplier 7 with the highest ambient clock (1.9). Titles bounce, items pop. Owns a ticker Scroll, click Cursor, pop Notify and bar Rings. For food halls, markets, festivals and nightlife.",
